WHAT THIS DOES NOT COVER

`asam-audit.csv` is a *derived* audit trail: reference numbers, dates,
durations, the reading rule applied to each, stratum, and inclusion. The
underlying Anti-Shipping Activity Messages records — including the incident
narratives — are published by the US National Geospatial-Intelligence Agency
at https://msi.nga.mil/Piracy and are not redistributed here. Obtain them from
the source; this licence grants no rights over them.

